OL,3,GNEWSAHauliers raise prices amid soaring
OL,4,Afuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen diesel prices hit record highs,
OL,7,FJonathon Clifft made a simple
OL,8,Fcalculation for his personal travel: if
OL,9,Fa journey was under an hour on foot,
OL,10,Finstead of driving he would walk.
OL,12,FThe Wolverhampton businessman, who runs
OL,13,FClifft Waste Management, said soaring
OL,14,Ffuel costs had changed daily routines
OL,15,Fthat once seemed insignificant.
OL,17,FHe said: "When I get my morning paper,
OL,18,Fif it's raining, I'd normally use the
OL,19,Fcar, now I use an umbrella."
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
