OL,3,GNEWSAHauliers raise prices amid soaring
OL,4,Afuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FClifft's story echoes millions of
OL,7,Fmotorists across the country facing
OL,8,Frising costs at the pump as UK diesel
OL,9,Fprices top #2 a litre for first time,
OL,10,Faccording to the RAC.
